  "$comment": [
    "PALETTE SEEDS - the five colours each theme actually provides.",
    "Everything else in a palette's 72 CSS custom properties is DERIVED from",
    "these five by apps/web/scripts/build-palettes.mjs. Editing a .tokens.css",
    "block by hand would be overwritten on the next build; edit this file, or",
    "add a `hand` field to opt a palette out of generation.",
    "",
    "The five, and what they are used for directly:",
    "  bg        --bg-0, and the base of every scrim and shadow",
    "  fg        --fg, and the base of every hairline and veil (tinted, never white)",
    "  muted     --fg-dim, comments, and the mid-tone between them",
    "  primary   --accent-a",
    "  secondary --accent-b"
